{"id": "unknown-2026-07-04-020", "date": "2026-07-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["construction_activity", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Kalmar is building – and selling! – these massive electric reach stackers in China", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/kalmar-electric-reachstacker_MAIN.png?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kalmar began building its 45-ton ERG450 electric reach stackers at a Shanghai manufacturing plant back in 2023, aiming to bring heavy-duty cargo handler closer to potential customers across the Asian market. That investment appears to be paying off, with the company announcing four new orders from to close out Q2.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/07/04/kalmar-is-building-and-selling-these-massive-electric-reach-stackers-in-china/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-04-021", "date": "2026-07-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["construction_activity"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "CATL is building more than 200 battery swap stations EVERY MONTH", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/catl_swap.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The CATL-backed Choco-SEB battery swap network deployed its 2,000th swapping station June 30th, wrapping up another month of incredibly rapid growth that’s seen the company average more than 200 deployments in <em>each</em> and <em>every</em> month of 2026. (!)</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/07/04/catl-is-building-more-than-200-battery-swap-stations-every-month/", "type": "rss"}]}
